00:45:33.272 --> 00:45:34.489
- Put that on. Okay, whip it.
- Thank you.


00:45:34.607 --> 00:45:36.655
- Whip it real good.
- I will.


00:45:41.864 --> 00:45:44.458
George, get up out this bed, son.


00:45:48.871 --> 00:45:50.043
Kate.


00:45:51.457 --> 00:45:53.801
I had this horrible dream


00:45:54.126 --> 00:45:57.596
