00:47:08.242 --> 00:47:09.494
I'm up.


00:47:09.577 --> 00:47:10.578
Thank you.


00:47:10.703 --> 00:47:13.957
I am definitely up.
You don't have to come back.


00:47:14.040 --> 00:47:17.419
I'm coming right down.
I'm coming right down.


00:47:19.253 --> 00:47:20.880
I'm on my way.


00:47:32.016 --> 00:47:33.063
Get up, son.


00:47:35.895 --> 00:47:36.942
What's wrong?


00:47:37.897 --> 00:47:39.695
You just scared me.


00:47:39.774 --> 00:47:44.075
You're just so huge.
Like a giant bag of Skittles.


00:47:45.529 --> 00:47:47.827
All right, you better get the hell up,


00:47:47.907 --> 00:47:49.750
