00:47:49.867 --> 00:47:52.245
You gonna taste the rainbow.


00:47:52.328 --> 00:47:55.298
We need to move him
to someplace safe now.


00:47:55.373 --> 00:47:57.546
Good idea. What do you suggest?


00:47:57.625 --> 00:47:59.719
I don't know,
but first thing tomorrow morning,


00:47:59.794 --> 00:48:00.966
they're on a plane headed here.


00:48:01.045 --> 00:48:04.515
You figure it out and tell no one.
Not even me.


00:48:06.050 --> 00:48:07.597
Sir, I've got kids at my house.


00:48:07.676 --> 00:48:09.303
I don't know what I would do
with a whole family of...


00:48:09.387 --> 00:48:11.810
I don't know. You've been
a prosecutor for over a year.


00:48:11.889 --> 00:48:15.063
This is a big case for you, Brian. Handle it.


00:48:15.393 --> 00:48:17.441
- Now, get UP-
- I'm up. I'm UP-


00:48:17.561 --> 00:48:20.781
Probably dreaming about Skittles
and Coca-Cola and Pepsi,


00:48:20.898 --> 00:48:23.242
diet soda and Mountain Dew
and Honey Buns,


00:48:23.317 --> 00:48:25.194
and damn Krispy Kreme and everything else.


00:48:25.277 --> 00:48:26.324
