Honey, who the hell is Sadie?


00:48:38.082 --> 00:48:40.084
Don't you use that kind of language with me.


00:48:40.167 --> 00:48:43.592
'Cause I'll have you fired.
Do you understand'?


00:48:43.671 --> 00:48:46.515
Mrs. Needleman. Okay, I get it.


00:48:46.632 --> 00:48:50.637
The mall is open, but there
ain't nobody in there shopping.


00:48:52.430 --> 00:48:53.556
What's that smell?


00:48:53.639 --> 00:48:56.142
