00:48:56.267 --> 00:48:59.271
It smells up the whole house. It permeates.


00:48:59.353 --> 00:49:04.154
Thank you. You always were
the best colored help we could ever find.


00:49:06.485 --> 00:49:09.284
Okay, Brian playing a joke on me.


00:49:09.363 --> 00:49:12.742
I'm being Punk'd. I know I'm being Punk'd.
Where the camera at?


00:49:12.825 --> 00:49:14.793
Little girl, I need you to get up, honey.


00:49:14.869 --> 00:49:16.667
Go away.


00:49:22.209 --> 00:49:26.214
Never had no child talk to me
like this before. Loroly.


00:49:26.338 --> 00:49:30.218
Honey, I got to bring y'all down to school
and get you registered. Now, get up.


00:49:32.344 --> 00:49:34.142
I said, go away.


00:49:36.724 --> 00:49:39.853
She just yelled at me in my house
I don't know what she...


00:49:39.977 --> 00:49:41.274
Little girl,
I'm gonna tell you one more time...


00:49:41.353 --> 00:49:43.401
I Said. go away!


00:49:51.197 --> 00:49:52.995
I know she didn't just...


00:49:58.162 --> 00:50:00.164
Who the hell you think
you talking to?


00:50:02.166 --> 00:50:05.090
Oh, my God! What is wrong with you?


00:50:05.211 --> 00:50:07.259
This is my house.


00:50:07.379 --> 00:50:09.882
You live by my rules
when you are in my house.


00:50:10.007 --> 00:50:12.180
You're too young for that, little girl.
You don't want none of this.


00:50:12.259 --> 00:50:16.264
Please, do yourself a favor, honey.
You do not want none of this.


00:50:16.388 --> 00:50:19.437
Behave while you're here. If not, you will...


00:50:22.895 --> 00:50:25.023
Girl, you...


00:50:25.105 --> 00:50:27.699
Girl, you just don't know...


00:50:31.445 --> 00:50:33.413
I don't know who she thinks
she's talking to.


00:50:33.739 --> 00:50:35.207
She's insane.


00:50:39.703 --> 00:50:40.704
Hello?


00:50:41.455 --> 00:50:42.627
Is that you, son?


00:50:45.251 --> 00:50:47.595
- Yes, sir.
- Well, come on in here.


00:50:50.047 --> 00:50:51.720
What are you doing here, Dad?


00:50:52.424 --> 00:50:54.597
Well, I'm feeling better, much better.


00:50:54.718 --> 00:50:58.768
No, you're not.
You're supposed to be at home in bed.


00:50:58.889 --> 00:51:02.939
I just had to stop by here
to make sure everything's all right.


00:51:03.435 --> 00:51:04.436
It's all fine.


00:51:04.937 --> 00:51:10.694
I've decided to tell the church
the third Sunday I'm retiring.


00:51:11.151 --> 00:51:13.153
I thought you were gonna wait
till summer to do that.


00:51:13.279 --> 00:51:16.704
No, I can't do that, son. I'm too tired.


00:51:16.782 --> 00:51:19.205
It'll sure make the burden so much easier


00:51:19.285 --> 00:51:24.257
