all these years is gonna be looked after.


00:51:24.331 --> 00:51:27.631
I am very proud of you, son.
Really proud of you.


00:51:28.961 --> 00:51:30.884
Don't be proud of me.


00:51:30.963 --> 00:51:33.512
Are you kidding me?
I have to tell you I'm proud of you.


00:51:33.632 --> 00:51:36.761
You know something?
After your mother died,


00:51:36.844 --> 00:51:38.141
I wasn't sure you were gonna make it.


00:51:39.179 --> 00:51:42.274
You were so far out there in those streets.


00:51:42.349 --> 00:51:44.192
But, praise the Lord, look at you now.


00:51:44.310 --> 00:51:48.941
Helping me run the church,
handling our mortgage payment fund.


00:51:49.023 --> 00:51:50.650
No, I am very proud of you, son.


00:51:51.066 --> 00:51:53.444
You know, the congregation
is gonna be a little bit upset


00:51:53.527 --> 00:51:57.498
