00:52:06.332 --> 00:52:07.800
Well done, son.


00:52:07.875 --> 00:52:09.218
Yes, sir.


00:52:18.510 --> 00:52:21.935
I don't see her out here. Y'all come on.
Come on. Hurry up.


00:52:22.014 --> 00:52:25.393
She always nosy as hell,
over there looking at everything.


00:52:25.476 --> 00:52:26.853
Hurry UP-


00:52:31.899 --> 00:52:34.493
- Come on. Get in the car.
- Madea.


00:52:34.568 --> 00:52:35.740
Madea.


00:52:35.944 --> 00:52:37.070
Hey, Hattie.


00:52:38.030 --> 00:52:39.202
How you doing?


00:52:39.281 --> 00:52:40.578
- I'm good, baby.
- Open the door.


00:52:40.658 --> 00:52:43.286
