in here that will help.


00:54:17.296 --> 00:54:19.173
I wanna help you. I really do.


00:54:19.256 --> 00:54:23.511
It doesn't make any sense
for me not to wanna help.


00:54:23.594 --> 00:54:26.313
Now does it? Does it? No. No.


00:54:26.388 --> 00:54:29.858
I mean, don't you think
I would help if I could?


00:54:33.604 --> 00:54:35.481
- Are you okay?
- No, I just...


00:54:35.564 --> 00:54:38.443
I feel like I... I wanna hit something.


00:54:38.525 --> 00:54:40.368
Hit the chair. Hit something.


00:54:50.954 --> 00:54:52.001
I'm sorry.


00:55:07.846 --> 00:55:09.940
That was a lovely evening.


00:55:11.850 --> 00:55:14.353
There ain't never been no evening, lady.
I don't know you.


00:55:14.853 --> 00:55:18.778
Stop it. There's no one around.


00:55:18.857 --> 00:55:21.861
Read my lips, honey. I don't know you.


00:55:22.820 --> 00:55:25.369
You're the man in the boat.


00:55:25.489 --> 00:55:27.537
I ain't never had no boat.


00:55:31.328 --> 00:55:35.128
I bet if I showed you my tattoo,
you might remember.


00:55:35.207 --> 00:55:38.006
What tattoo? What you fixing to show me?


00:55:42.881 --> 00:55:45.555
I believe you need to see a doctor
