you guys all the way to your barracks.


00:56:48.572 --> 00:56:50.950
Yeah, I remember it was four of you.


00:56:51.074 --> 00:56:57.377
It was Blanche, Rose, Dorothy, and you.


00:57:00.626 --> 00:57:02.219
I don't even know
how you remember that, honey.


00:57:02.294 --> 00:57:05.218
That was 56, 57 years ago.


00:57:05.297 --> 00:57:07.391
Fifty-three.


00:57:07.466 --> 00:57:09.594
Because George is 52.


00:57:11.970 --> 00:57:13.893
What that got to do with anything?


00:57:16.308 --> 00:57:18.561
What day is it?


00:57:19.061 --> 00:57:22.611
Lady, don't you start...
What you trying to tell me?


00:57:24.608 --> 00:57:25.985
Where am I?


00:57:26.068 --> 00:57:28.742
I think you believe you're trying
to tell me something about George.


00:57:28.820 --> 00:57:30.572
- Oh, my goodness.
- Hey.


00:57:30.656 --> 00:57:32.408
I don't know where I am.


00:57:38.830 --> 00:57:40.127
George?


00:57:44.002 --> 00:57:45.094
