00:57:54.638 --> 00:57:56.356
Tell him the truth.


00:57:56.473 --> 00:57:57.520
That will kill him.


00:57:57.599 --> 00:57:59.943
He'll be very happy
that you told him the truth.


00:58:00.018 --> 00:58:01.611
I can't. I can't do it.


00:58:01.687 --> 00:58:02.939
Jake.


00:58:03.021 --> 00:58:05.023
That's him. That's the dude from the news!


00:58:05.691 --> 00:58:06.943
I ought to kill you!


00:58:07.025 --> 00:58:09.369
