How about that?


00:58:32.175 --> 00:58:34.052
I'm gonna... Get off.


00:58:34.511 --> 00:58:36.809
Calm down. Nobody's kicking balls.


00:58:36.888 --> 00:58:39.186
George, Jake, I need you both to calm down.


00:58:39.266 --> 00:58:40.734
Is everything all right out there?


00:58:40.851 --> 00:58:42.068
Everything's fine.


00:58:44.187 --> 00:58:45.985
Just keep working. It's all good.


00:58:46.690 --> 00:58:48.738
George, this is Jake.


00:58:49.401 --> 00:58:52.826
His father has a church,
and they were gonna pay off their mortgage,


00:58:52.904 --> 00:58:56.750
and they invested the money in Lockwise,
and they lost it all.


00:58:56.825 --> 00:58:58.827
So he's a little bit upset.


00:58:58.910 --> 00:59:01.504
- I'm sorry.
- You...


00:59:02.914 --> 00:59:04.632
That's all you got to say? ls you sorry?


00:59:04.708 --> 00:59:06.130
- Jake.
- Hell...


00:59:06.209 --> 00:59:08.462
Yeah. Okay, okay.
You better watch yourself,


00:59:08.545 --> 00:59:09.797
or I'm gonna give you a...


00:59:09.880 --> 00:59:13.510
You see this? Big five. Big five.
And you're gonna get it.


00:59:13.592 --> 00:59:15.936
If I didn't have to go to the bathroom,
you'd be in...


00:59:16.011 --> 00:59:17.854
- Where's the bathroom, Brian?
- Okay.


00:59:17.929 --> 00:59:19.055
Third door on the left.


00:59:19.139 --> 00:59:21.062
- Third door on the left.
- Yeah.


00:59:21.975 --> 00:59:23.352
Big five?


00:59:24.644 --> 00:59:27.614
Jake, go home.


00:59:28.899 --> 00:59:31.652
Get a grip, okay? Tell him the truth.


00:59:32.110 --> 00:59:34.158
If anything comes up, I'll call you.


00:59:34.237 --> 00:59:37.207
Can't you just go home?
Elevator's right there.


00:59:47.084 --> 00:59:48.882
How tall are you, son?


00:59:50.128 --> 00:59:52.972
About 6 feet.


00:59:53.298 --> 00:59:55.096
- About 6 feet?
- Yeah.


00:59:56.551 --> 00:59:58.724
Okay. Check.


